  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Welcome to Serendipity at Saltwater—a brand-new luxury retreat just a 5-minute walk from the Scenic 395 Beach Access! With a private pool, high-end finishes, and space for up to 14 guests, this stunning home is ideal for families, groups, and beach lovers alike. Set in the heart of Old Seagrove and just minutes from Seaside, this coastal escape blends bold architectural design with ultimate walkability on 30A.<br><br>Traveling with a larger group? The home next door is also available and accommodates an additional 14 guests!<br><br>If you'd like to use the on-site golf cart during your stay, it’s available to rent for $99 per day. Please reach out for details and availability. A signed golf cart agreement is required for all licensed drivers.<br><br>☼ 5 Bedrooms + private carriage suite<br>☼ Sleeps 14<br>☼ Private pool<br>☼ Walk to Scenic 395 Beach Access (5 minutes)<br>☼ Minutes to Seaside, restaurants, and live music<br>☼ 5 full bathrooms + 1 half bathroom<br>☼ Double laundry rooms (1 upstairs, 1 downstairs)<br>☼ Large covered patio with turf courtyard<br>☼ Full kitchen with modern appliances<br>☼ Outdoor grill + plenty of dining space<br>☼ 6 Bikes<br><br>Sleeping Arrangements:<br>First Floor<br>☼ 1 King suite with en-suite bathroom on the main floor — ideal for those who prefer to avoid stairs<br>☼ 1 King suite with en-suite bathroom attached outside on the main floor — ideal for those who prefer to avoid stairs<br>☼ 1 Queen Sleeper sofa in the main living area<br><br>Second Floor<br>☼ 3 King suites on the second floor, each with en-suite bathrooms<br>☼ Living room couch with pullout queen and twin size bed in the ottoman<br>Sleeps 15 actually but advertised at 14 for space and county limits. <br><br>Outdoor & Community Perks:<br>☼ Private pool<br>☼ Covered patio and turf courtyard for outdoor lounging<br>☼ Outdoor grill + dining space for alfresco meals<br>☼ Golf cart available upon request (additional fee)<br><br>Home Amenities:<br>☼ Electric hearth + accordion doors for indoor-outdoor flow<br>☼ Floating staircase + tranquil water feature in entry<br>☼ High ceilings with dramatic wood beams<br>☼ Pet-friendly for approved furry friends ($150 pet fee per pet)<br><br>Closest Beach Access Point:<br>☼ Scenic 395 Beach Access<br>→ 2780 E County Hwy 30A, Santa Rosa Beach, FL 32459<br><br>Guest Access:<br>☼ Full access to the main home and carriage suite<br>☼ 6 bikes<br>☼ Private pool and fenced backyard<br>☼ Driveway parking for up to 4 vehicles + 2 additional parallel street spaces<br>☼ Scenic 395 Beach Access—just a 5-minute walk away<br><br>30A Beach Stays provides a few starter essentials to kick off your stay:<br>We’ve stocked the home with starter essentials:<br>☼ Full Bath: Travel Size shampoo, conditioner, hand/face bar, massage body bar, 2 toilet paper rolls<br>☼ Half Bath: Hand soap, 2 toilet paper rolls<br>☼ Kitchen: 2 dishwasher pods, 2 laundry pods, 1 sponge, small dish soap, 1 roll of paper towels<br>☼ Trash Bags: A few liners per bathroom & kitchen bins<br>If you're staying longer or need more of anything, let us know — we're happy to recommend the closest grocery or convenience stores!<br><br>☼ A signed rental agreement is required before check-in (only needs to be signed by the guest who booked).<br>☼ A golf cart agreement must be signed before the golf cart code is shared. You’ll receive a link in your check-in message.<br>☼ Guests ages 18–24 with no one over 25 in the group will be required to pay a security deposit.<br><br>To ensure a comfortable and enjoyable experience for everyone, we kindly ask that all guests follow the house rules below. Booking your stay confirms your agreement to these terms:<br><br>☼ Rental agreement must be signed before check-in<br>☼ No smoking of any kind inside the home<br>☼ No parties or events without prior written approval<br>☼ Quiet hours are from 10:00 PM to 6:00 AM<br>☼ Maximum occupancy must be respected at all times<br>☼ Guest count must be disclosed accurately at the time of booking<br>☼ Parking rules must be followed; improperly parked vehicles may be towed, booted, or fined<br>☼ No personal items may be hung over balconies, railings, or outdoor structures<br>☼ Please treat the property with care and report any damages promptly<br><br>Failure to follow these rules may result in additional fees, eviction without refund, and/or forfeiture of the security deposit (if applicable).<br><br>We appreciate your cooperation and are here to help if you have any questions!",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
